tly in the browser.\n- `hermes_cli/subcommands/dashboard.py:20` defines the upstream `dashboard` subcommand with help text `Start the web UI dashboard`.\n\nThe earlier comment linking the downstream `hermes-workspace` fork was useful at the time, but upstream now ships the corresponding dashboard/chat interface directly.\n", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4667741614/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}]